            <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That’s your reason.”</span> He walks over and takes the backpack back from you. You turn to him confused. You thought he wanted him to carry it? <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“And you did. Sure, you have your reasons, but that’s why it lost its appeal. I love being in control, it’s only right, but I also enjoy a challenge. And it’s hard to be challenged when everyone is so scared or awed or intimidated to give you one. I love winning, but sometimes I want to earn it.”</span> He explains, continuing to walk away from the mall to the west. <br>
        <br>
