    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Tell him to carry it himself<br>">>
	<<replace "#choice">>
        You toss his backpack back towards him, telling him to carry it himself. You already have your own and you’re not some mule like his other followers. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> glares at you in response. You wonder if he’s going to get mad or threaten you, but instead he smiles. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That’s why I like you.”</span> He laughs, picking up his bag.

            <<set _ad to [
                {
