                        Mouth: "Smirk",
                        Eyes: "Tired",
                        },
                    },
                ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I like to win, and it’s only right that I do.”</span> He explains as you continue following him, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But just because I like to win doesn’t mean I hate a challenge. In fact, I think it’s important that I be challenged every now and again. Where’s the fun of the game if everyone just gives me the victory? That is how it lost its appeal.”</span> He stops suddenly, spinning around on his heel and leaning towards you with a menacing smile, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Now, this isn’t me telling you to act out. As I said, it is only right that I win, but I find your little acts of defiance cute. It makes it all the better when you do listen.”</span> He pats you on the head before continuing. <br>
        <br>
        His mannerisms are a little confusing. <span style="color:Yellow">You can’t be sure if he wants you to listen like a good little dog or defy his orders. It’s almost like he wants you to do both and neither at the same time?</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Xavier Collections Quest 2]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
