:: Xavier Collections Quest 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */
You continue to follow <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> as he moves closer towards the beach. At first, you consider that as your destination, until your friend turns a bit before it and you find yourself in the trailer park in the southern part of town. As you walk past the collection of mobile homes and RVs, you eventually reach a small trailer on the edge of the lot. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> stops and points it out, <span style="color:Yellow">indicating this is your goal.</span>

