        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hope you enjoyed our little adventure.”</span> He says, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Though I’m a bit surprised you chose something so tame. Could have made him do anything, to be honest. Though maybe you’re just not used to being the one in charge.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> leans in close with a smirk, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Or maybe you just prefer to be the one on their knees. Either way, it was nice having you along.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> steps back and chuckles, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I should really be heading home though. So much to do, so little time. I’ll see you around, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$XavierNickname</span>. Do have a good rest of your day.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> turns and departs with a wave, leaving you a little bit confused about what just happened. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> <span style="color:Yellow">is a lot scarier than you realized.</span> <br>
